# SIDEQUESTS

Cross-project nugget store. Ideas, experiments, and side projects that came up
while working on this repo but don't belong to it. Future sessions in ANY repo
can scan all SIDEQUESTS.chloeai files across `~/Documents/Projects/**/` to
surface parked ideas by tag or status.

## Convention

Each entry uses this shape:

```
## YYYY-MM-DD -- <Short title>
Status: parked | active | shipped | dropped
Tags: <comma-separated, lowercase, kebab-case>
Origin: <repo or context where the idea came up>
Body:
<the idea, design notes, why-it-matters, what-would-make-it-real>
```

Status meanings:
- **parked**: captured, not being worked on, may revisit
- **active**: someone is actively working on it (note where)
- **shipped**: built and in use somewhere
- **dropped**: explicitly decided not to pursue (keep entry as a "we considered this" record)

Scan command (any future session):
```
glob: ~/Documents/Projects/**/SIDEQUESTS.chloeai
```

Filter by tag/status by reading and grepping.

